<concept_spec>

concept Vision

purpose
    per-frame detection of people and phones

state
    a counter Number for deterministic outputs in MVP
    a set of Detections with
        a frameId String
        a studentCount Number
        a phoneUsers Number

actions
    analyzeFrame (frameId: String) : (frameId: String, studentCount: Number, phoneUsers: Number)
        run detection for the frame and store results
        return frameId, studentCount, phoneUsers

queries
    _getDetections (frameId: String) : (frameId: String, studentCount: Number, phoneUsers: Number)
        fetch detections for a frame

</concept_spec>

